      "locked": false,
      "text": "user upload a video to the server\n\nthe server stores the metadata and the accompanying user data to the database and, at the same time hands over the video to the encoder for encoding\n\nthe encoder along with transcoder, compress the video and transforms it into multiple resolutions and store to blog storage \n\nsome popular videos will be send to the CDN\n\n\nAPI Design \n\n\n\n\n            \n        ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "user upload a video to the server\n\nthe server stores the metadata and the accompanying user data to the database and, at the same time hands over the video to the encoder for encoding\n\nthe encoder along with transcoder, compress the video and transforms it into multiple resolutions and store to blog storage \n\nsome popular videos will be send to the CDN\n\n\nAPI Design \n\n\n\n\n            \n        ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "S1krWFdOoDqAOu9V6lh9y",
